(2)

(3)

Penyelenggara atau pengelola pelayanan dilarang memungut biaya apapun terhadap korban kekerasan.

translated_text:
Article 36

The provision of services to Victims as referred to in Article 28 is carried out every day (including holidays), in a manner that is:

a. fast;
b. safe and comfortable;
c. empathetic;
d. non-discriminatory;
e. easily accessible;
f. not charged; and
g. guaranteed confidentiality.

(2)

(3)

Service providers or service managers are prohibited from charging any fees to victims of violence.

